IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q07-ATM-WITHDRAWAL.
*> ATM withdrawal checks with clear rejection order:
*> 1.ERR_ATM 2.ERR_INACTIVE 3.ERR_AMOUNT 4.ERR_FUNDS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-BALANCE          PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-WITHDRAW         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-ACCT-STAT        PIC X(1).
01  WS-ATM-STAT         PIC X(1).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-BALANCE
    ACCEPT WS-WITHDRAW
    ACCEPT WS-ACCT-STAT
    ACCEPT WS-ATM-STAT

    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-ATM-STAT NOT = "Y"
            DISPLAY "ERR_ATM"
        WHEN WS-ACCT-STAT NOT = "A"
            DISPLAY "ERR_INACTIVE"
        WHEN WS-WITHDRAW <= 0
            DISPLAY "ERR_AMOUNT"
        WHEN WS-WITHDRAW > WS-BALANCE
            DISPLAY "ERR_FUNDS"
        WHEN OTHER
            SUBTRACT WS-WITHDRAW FROM WS-BALANCE
            DISPLAY "SUCCESS"
            DISPLAY "REMAINING BALANCE: " WS-BALANCE
    END-EVALUATE
    STOP RUN.
